[Music]  I'm Victoria Lancia and I'm the owner of  panzerotti bytes with my husband  Pasquale  so panzerotto is a specialty food from  Puglia which is the heel of the boot of  Italy panzerotti is very similar to a  calzone but it is different because of  the dough the dough is very light is  highly digestible so you can eat more  instead of just eating one calzone you  can try different panzerotti and we fry  panzerotti because this is the  traditional way that people eat and  prepare panzerotti but even if it is  fried it is not greasy nor oily and we  import a lot of ingredients from Puglia  or from italy to make the authentic  panzerotti here in new york panzerotti  is a street food so you can eat you must  eat with your hands  paying attention not to make a mess in  your clothes because sometimes the  mozzarella and the tomato sauce can fall  so you should eat like this or like  these bite after bite  so to make fun 0 2 you can roll down the  dough and then you can add some sweet or  savory ingredients then you fold it up  and then you can fry it  the panzerotti dough is very similar to  the pizza dough is made of extra virgin  olive oil salt water fresh yeast and  zero-zero flour that we import from  Italy we prepare the dough in the dough  mixer and then we can cut small pieces  with them and then make a little ball  with our ends and then we move them to  the refrigerator for 48 hours everyone  from Puglia or from italy knows the  classic pan zero team so to prepare a  classic panzerotto you have to roll down  the dough put some fresh mozzarella a  little bit of tomato sauce and then a  little bit of oregano and then you can  close the panzerotto in a house moon  shape it with your hands you can close  borders and then you can fry it here in  New York we are also offering a new  version of panzerotti which is called  guru my panzerotto so the difference is  that the gourmet is fried empty and then  afterwards we cut in half and put some  fresh ingredients so it will look like a  sandwich and we customize the panzerotto  with an iron so if you can always  recognize that that is a panzerotto from  panzer device  [Music]  panzerotti means a lot for boolean  people it has part of our life of our  story so for us even if it is very  similar in the shape of an empanada or a  calzone our dumplings panzerotti is a  unique food it can't be compared to  anything else  [Music]

